      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "The same agents at preset 9: they sense only 4 cells ahead, so instead of a network they pull each other into long threads that wander and loop. Sense Angle, Turn Angle and Sense Dist are the whole of a preset, with Mode; set Mode to Repel and the threads shatter into cells. Decay is how long the scent lingers."
        }
      },
